    {
      "id": "claim_ce7d00138ae64dc480a968f8fe793b07",
      "statement": "Three scope sets exist: AUTH_SCOPES (offline_access + user-details.read, for transient sign-in grants), BILLING_SCOPES (offline_access aig.read aig.run user-details.read account-settings.read, no openid), and persistentScopesForResources which adds workers-observability.read when observability resources are requested.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/gatekeeper-cloudflare/src/oauth.ts#L18-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a14ede29cf3aad2782926125847ba47c33968774898cecf7ca34887c329b4b47:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_846822893cbe4b1385b86c88e3885e79",
      "statement": "Scopes fail closed: beginOAuthFlow falls back to exactly the billing set when the stored scopes key is missing, acceptAuthCode records tokens.scopes ?? stored ?? billing as grantedScopes so a provider that omits scope cannot advertise an observability grant, and getGrantedScopes treats legacy accounts as billing-only.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/gatekeeper-cloudflare/src/cloudflare.ts#L244-L247",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3f7124a1b511e67dd323138e89471797878a86f0e6207ce07f8e7b55d86d0b94:"
