    {
      "id": "claim_619209f487da45deab32d42901cd347f",
      "statement": "The billing/BYOK flow reads a usable token via getUsableAccessToken -> UserAccount.getAccessToken, which caches the access token with an expiry safety margin and refreshes from the stored refresh token, notifying the workshop via callback.credentialsExpired() when refresh fails.",
      "evidence": [
