    {
      "id": "claim_3ae57560462f491f81df42d4d62ae69a",
      "statement": "The two observability resource granularities (whole account vs one named Worker) both map to the single indivisible workers-observability.read scope; the granularity is determined by the resource URL parsed by parseObservabilityResourceUrl, so the capability boundary is the binding, not the grant.",
