    {
      "id": "claim_94dc95b804d944798b9924b8e6e69fe2",
      "statement": "calculate() is the one observability read whose safety rests solely on the injected $metadata.service filter, because an aggregate cannot be un-mixed; this asymmetry is accepted and documented on the method, with the group-by fix left as a follow-up.",
      "evidence": [
        {
