    {
      "id": "claim_8b263974fa614c3f8cf798a233ac1db5",
      "statement": "deniesAccess maps only 400/401/403/404 to 'the credential lacks access'; 5xx and transport failures are the gatekeeper's problem and must never be reported as a denial, because mapping a failure to 'allowed' would admit an unauthorized reader.",
      "evidence": [
