    {
      "id": "claim_07e80a7947e64b62ba72aa49e7759a9f",
      "statement": "Every observability read funnels through #observe, which awaits authorizeObservation before returning data, and queue entries are built by summarizeFilter which shows only field names and operations, keeping caller-supplied filter values out of the audit trail.",
